    "sections": {
        "description": "Nova Coffee Shop theme offers an organised website structure with configurable homepage sections and flexible customization settings. It includes dedicated areas for featured content, menu displays, image galleries, testimonials, contact information, and promotional banners. Users can customise typography, colours, navigation menus, widget areas, headers, footers, and logo settings using the built-in Customizer without editing the theme files. These options help maintain a consistent appearance throughout the website. The theme supports the block editor and integrates with commonly used page-building tools for flexible page creation. Compatibility with plugins for SEO, contact forms, caching, and security extends the available functionality while maintaining stable performance. Translation-ready support simplifies multilingual content management, and standard coding practices help maintain compatibility with future platform updates. Additional settings allow adjustments to page spacing, content placement, image displays, widgets, and footer layouts. Nova Coffee Shop provides organised layout controls and flexible design options that support ongoing website updates while preserving a structured presentation and consistent navigation across different pages."
    },
